    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "1st period",
        "score": "BOS 1, STL 1",
        "text": "Casey Mittelstadt picked off a Joel Hofer clearing attempt behind the Blues' net, and James Hagens tipped his feed past Hofer at 5:28 for a 1–0 lead. At 15:43, four seconds into a St. Louis power play, Jimmy Snuggerud one-timed Philip Broberg's pass inside the near post to tie it 1–1, ending the Blues' 138:38 scoreless stretch. St. Louis outshot Boston 10–8 in the period."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "STL 3, BOS 1",
        "text": "Broberg wristed a shot from the slot over Jeremy Swayman's glove at 5:17 after Connor McMichael found him from behind the net, making it 2–1. At 12:08, Robert Thomas, left unmarked in the slot, took a pass from Justin Barron and beat Swayman high for 3–1."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "Final: STL 4, BOS 1",
        "text": "Marco Sturm shuffled his lines, moving David Pastrnak around, and Boston outshot St. Louis 14–2, but Hofer stopped all 14. Jake Neighbours put away the rebound of a Broberg shot on the power play at 12:42 for the 4–1 final; the Blues went 2-for-3 on the power play, Boston 0-for-2."
      }
    ],
